        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Neosho_Falls%2C_Kansas",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Named after the falls on the Neosho River, Neosho Falls sits beside its namesake waterway.",
