      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Neosho_Falls%2C_Kansas",
      "category": "people",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Union Pacific Railroad pushed through Neosho Falls, establishing a depot and large storehouse in the town’s southern part.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        12
